 AddSpecialMessage←{
⍝ Returns the band carrying a general message for ALL HTML pages in case the INI file says so,
⍝ otherwise ''. `HtmlHeader` puts it right below the site header.
⍝ Every entry of "MSG:Text" becomes a paragraph of its own. "MSG:CSS", when given, is still
⍝ written onto the band as an inline style.
⍝ Both entries are optional, as is the whole [MSG] section, hence the defaults.
     0=≢∊msg←⊆⊃'' G.INI.Get'MSG:Text':''
     css←⊃'' G.INI.Get'MSG:CSS'
     style←{0=≢⍵:⍵ ⋄ ' style="',⍵,'"'}css
     html←⊂'<div id="special-message" class="noprint"',style,'>'
     html,←⊂'<p class="special-message-label">Notice</p>'
     html,←{'<p>',⍵,'</p>'}¨msg
     html,⊂'</div>'
 }
